    "text": "BY virtue of the powers vested in me under the Article 45(2) of the Constitution of the Democratic Socialist Republic of SriLanka I, hereby declare that the following functions of the subjects under the purview of Ministry of Power & RenewableEnergy shall be assigned to the Deputy Minister of Power & Renewable Energy.",
