      481.47,
      473.56
    ],
    "text": "01. All the parliamentary affairs related to the Ministry of Power & Renewable Energy.02. Labour relations of all the institutions under the purview of Ministry of Power & Renewable Energy.03. Coordination of the activities related to the Sampur Coal Power Project.04. Coordination of all the activities related to the Generation Plan of Ceylon Electricity Board.",
